# ISO 27001 – Technological Controls Audit (Windows)

This PowerShell audit collects evidence aligned to ISO 27001 Annex A technological themes
(e.g., access control, endpoint protection, logging/monitoring, configuration, encryption, network security).
It produces time-stamped JSON and CSV summaries in a local `reports` folder.

> ⚠️ This is a **read-only** audit. It does **not** change system configuration.

## Run

```powershell
# From repo root
Set-Location "scripts\audit\ISO 27001"
.\Invoke-ISO27001TechAudit.ps1 -OutDir .\reports
